From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:06:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! transaction(v2): integrate native transaction
 identities and serialization

Update the native block-filter roundtrip fixture for canonical output-script storage at immutable V7 construction. The old raw-versus-decoded inequality is stale after the owning transaction integration repair. Preserve block hash, TxId, encoded-filter and filter-hash invariants; add exact wire reserialization, complete consumption and canonical-script membership checks. Production sources are unchanged.

Owning-Stable-ID: split-125
Owning-Native-Patch: v2/045
Fixture-Provenance: git blame attributes this native filter test to the same transaction identities/serialization owner.
Validation: full blockfilter suite before fails exactly one stale inequality (262/263 assertions); after passes all 6 cases and 269 assertions using one isolated test-object replacement linked against frozen ABI-matched205 inputs. No top-level Ninja, production/source-cache changes, or209 runtime approval.
---
 src/test/blockfilter_tests.cpp | 16 +++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/test/blockfilter_tests.cpp b/src/test/blockfilter_tests.cpp
index 7bb9f3a5f9..8a0c9818e5 100644
--- a/src/test/blockfilter_tests.cpp
+++ b/src/test/blockfilter_tests.cpp
@@ -162,12 +162,26 @@ BOOST_AUTO_TEST_CASE(native_output_filter_is_stable_across_wire_roundtrip) {
     const BlockFilter before(BlockFilterType::BASIC, block, {});
     DataStream wire;
     wire << block;
+    const std::string serialized = wire.str();
     CBlock decoded;
     wire >> decoded;
+    BOOST_REQUIRE(wire.empty());
     BOOST_REQUIRE(block.GetHash() == decoded.GetHash());
     BOOST_REQUIRE(block.vtx[0]->GetId() == decoded.vtx[0]->GetId());
-    BOOST_CHECK(block.vtx[0]->vout[0].scriptPubKey != decoded.vtx[0]->vout[0].scriptPubKey);
+    // Immutable V7 construction now stores the canonical output script, just
+    // as wire decoding does. The representation must already match here.
+    const CScript &canonical_script = block.vtx[0]->vout[0].scriptPubKey;
+    BOOST_REQUIRE(!canonical_script.empty());
+    BOOST_CHECK(canonical_script == decoded.vtx[0]->vout[0].scriptPubKey);
+    DataStream reserialized;
+    reserialized << decoded;
+    BOOST_CHECK(reserialized.str() == serialized);
     const BlockFilter after(BlockFilterType::BASIC, decoded, {});
+    const GCSFilter::Element element(canonical_script.begin(),
+                                     canonical_script.end());
+    BOOST_CHECK_EQUAL(before.GetFilter().GetN(), 1U);
+    BOOST_CHECK(before.GetFilter().Match(element));
+    BOOST_CHECK(after.GetFilter().Match(element));
     BOOST_CHECK(before.GetEncodedFilter() == after.GetEncodedFilter());
     BOOST_CHECK(before.GetHash() == after.GetHash());
 }
